  (text "Nominal gain0.5; use2x voltage scaling in calibration.\nRC, opamp offset, diode leakage, ADC sample time and reference error require analysis.\nFault clamps inject into3V3 rail: power-off/backfeed and simultaneous fault tests BLOCK RELEASE.\nThese are candidates for 0..5V sensors; no raw battery input or load may be connected."
